  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>武汉暴雨专题报道</title>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <section\n        style=\"max-width:100%; margin:0; padding:0; font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; color:#333; line-height:1.6; background-color:#f9f9f9;\">\n\n        <!-- 标题区域 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"background-color:#1e3a8a; color:white; padding:25px 20px; border-radius:0 0 30px 30px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); margin-bottom:20px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;\">\n            <section style=\"position:relative; z-index:2;\">\n                <section style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:5px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#a5b4fc;\">\n                    BREAKING NEWS</section>\n                <h1\n                    style=\"margin:0; font-size:32px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.5px; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n                    武汉暴雨</h1>\n                <section style=\"width:60px; height:4px; background-color:#f97316; margin:10px 0 15px;\"></section>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:16px; font-weight:400; opacity:0.9;\">24小时持续降雨 最大时雨量达80毫米</p>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 事件概述 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"background-color:white; border-radius:20px; padding:25px 20px; margin:0 15px 20px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n            <h2\n                style=\"margin:0 0 15px; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#1e3a8a; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                <span\n                    style=\"display:inline-block; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#1e3a8a; margin-right:10px;\"></span>\n                事件概述\n            </h2>\n            <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#4b5563;\">近日，武汉遭遇一轮强降雨天气过程，主要降雨时段持续长达<span\n                    style=\"font-weight:600; color:#1e3a8a;\">24小时</span>。据气象部门监测，此次降雨的最大小时雨量达到<span\n                    style=\"font-weight:600; color:#1e3a8a;\">80毫米</span>，创下近期降雨强度纪录。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 影响范围 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"background-color:white; border-radius:20px; padding:25px 20px; margin:0 15px 20px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n            <h2\n                style=\"margin:0 0 15px; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#1e3a8a; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                <span\n                    style=\"display:inline-block; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#1e3a8a; margin-right:10px;\"></span>\n                影响范围\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- 交通影响卡片 -->\n            <section style=\"background-color:#f0f4ff; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:20px;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:18px; font-weight:600; color:#1e40af; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                    <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"margin-right:8px;\">\n                        <path fill=\"#1e40af\"\n                            d=\"M19,15H5V14H3V17H21V14H19V15M17,10H7V9H5V12H19V9H17V10M14,5H10V4H8V7H16V4H14V5Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                    交通影响\n                </h3>\n                <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:15px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4b5563;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">城区多处主要道路出现严重积水现象</li>\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">地铁4号线部分区段因积水临时停运</li>\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">天河国际机场取消航班30余架次</li>\n                </ul>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- 民生影响卡片 -->\n            <section style=\"background-color:#fff7ed; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:18px; font-weight:600; color:#c2410c; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                    <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"margin-right:8px;\">\n                        <path fill=\"#c2410c\"\n                            d=\"M12,3L2,12H5V20H19V12H22L12,3M12,8.75A2.25,2.25 0 0,1 14.25,11A2.25,2.25 0 0,1 12,13.25A2.25,2.25 0 0,1 9.75,11A2.25,2.25 0 0,1 12,8.75M12,15C13.5,15 16.5,15.75 16.5,17.25V18H7.5V17.25C7.5,15.75 10.5,15 12,15Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                    民生影响\n                </h3>\n                <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:15px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4b5563;\">\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">超过50个居民小区出现不同程度内涝</li>\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">紧急转移安置群众2000余人</li>\n                    <li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">周边郊区农作物受灾面积达5000亩以上</li>\n                </ul>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 应对措施 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"background-color:#1e3a8a; color:white; border-radius:20px; padding:25px 20px; margin:0 15px 20px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 15px; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                <span\n                    style=\"display:inline-block; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background-color:white; margin-right:10px;\"></span>\n                应对措施\n            </h2>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 15px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; opacity:0.9;\">武汉市立即启动防汛Ⅱ级应急响应：</p>\n\n            <section style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:15px;\">\n                <section\n                    style=\"flex:1 1 45%; min-width:130px; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:12px; padding:15px; backdrop-filter:blur(5px);\">\n                    <section style=\"font-size:28px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:5px;\">5000+</section>\n                    <section style=\"font-size:14px; opacity:0.8;\">累计出动各类抢险人员</section>\n                </section>\n                <section\n                    style=\"flex:1 1 45%; min-width:130px; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:12px; padding:15px; backdrop-filter:blur(5px);\">\n                    <section style=\"font-size:28px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:5px;\">200+</section>\n                    <section style=\"font-size:14px; opacity:0.8;\">调集大型排涝设备台套</section>\n                </section>\n                <section\n                    style=\"flex:1 1 45%; min-width:130px; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:12px; padding:15px; backdrop-filter:blur(5px);\">\n                    <section style=\"font-size:28px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:5px;\">20</section>\n                    <section style=\"font-size:14px; opacity:0.8;\">开设临时安置点处</section>\n                </section>\n                <section\n                    style=\"flex:1 1 45%; min-width:130px; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:12px; padding:15px; backdrop-filter:blur(5px);\">\n                    <section style=\"font-size:28px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:5px;\">24h</section>\n                    <section style=\"font-size:14px; opacity:0.8;\">组织疏散救援队伍待命</section>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 经验总结 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"background-color:white; border-radius:20px; padding:25px 20px; margin:0 15px 20px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n            <h2\n                style=\"margin:0 0 15px; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#1e3a8a; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                <span\n                    style=\"display:inline-block; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#1e3a8a; margin-right:10px;\"></span>\n                经验总结\n            </h2>\n\n            <section style=\"margin-bottom:15px; padding-left:10px; border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;\">\n                <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 5px; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#1e3a8a;\">城市排水系统建设</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">暴露出现有排水设施应对极端天气能力不足</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"margin-bottom:15px; padding-left:10px; border-left:3px solid #f97316;\">\n                <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 5px; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#c2410c;\">应急响应机制完善</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">多部门联动机制发挥关键作用</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"margin-bottom:15px; padding-left:10px; border-left:3px solid #10b981;\">\n                <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 5px; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#047857;\">公众防灾意识提升</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">通过媒体预警有效减少了人员伤亡</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding-left:10px; border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6;\">\n                <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 5px; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#5b21b6;\">气象预警信息发布</h3>\n                <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">提前6小时发出暴雨红色预警</p>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 未来展望 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4ff 0%, #e0e7ff 100%); border-radius:20px; padding:25px 20px; margin:0 15px 20px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n            <h2\n                style=\"margin:0 0 15px; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#1e3a8a; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                <span\n                    style=\"display:inline-block; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#1e3a8a; margin-right:10px;\"></span>\n                未来展望\n            </h2>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#4b5563;\">面对可能增多的极端天气事件，武汉应：</p>\n\n            <section style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                <section\n                    style=\"width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#3b82f6; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; margin-right:15px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill:white;\">\n                        <path\n                            d=\"M12,3L2,12H5V20H19V12H22L12,3M9,8H11V12H9V8M13,8H15V12H13V8M9,14H11V18H9V14M13,14H15V18H13V14Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </section>\n                <section style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">加强城市防洪排涝基础设施建设</section>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                <section\n                    style=\"width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#f97316; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; margin-right:15px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill:white;\">\n                        <path\n                            d=\"M9,5H10V7H9V5M15,5H16V7H15V5M9,17H10V19H9V17M15,17H16V19H15V17M5,9H7V10H5V9M17,9H19V10H17V9M5,15H7V16H5V15M17,15H19V16H17V15M12,2A10,10 0 0,0 2,12A10,10 0 0,0 12,22A10,10 0 0,0 22,12A10,10 0 0,0 12,2M12,20A8,8 0 0,1 4,12A8,8 0 0,1 12,4A8,8 0 0,1 20,12A8,8 0 0,1 12,20Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </section>\n                <section style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">完善分级分类的极端天气应对预案</section>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                <section\n                    style=\"width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#10b981; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; margin-right:15px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill:white;\">\n                        <path\n                            d=\"M12,3C7.58,3 4,4.79 4,7C4,9.21 7.58,11 12,11C16.42,11 20,9.21 20,7C20,4.79 16.42,3 12,3M4,9V12C4,14.21 7.58,16 12,16C16.42,16 20,14.21 20,12V9C20,11.21 16.42,13 12,13C7.58,13 4,11.21 4,9M4,14V17C4,19.21 7.58,21 12,21C16.42,21 20,19.21 20,17V14C20,16.21 16.42,18 12,18C7.58,18 4,16.21 4,14Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </section>\n                <section style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">引入智慧防汛监测预警系统</section>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n                <section\n                    style=\"width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#8b5cf6; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; margin-right:15px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill:white;\">\n                        <path\n                            d=\"M14,11.5H16.5V13H14V11.5M8,9H10.5V10.5H8V9M8,13H10.5V14.5H8V13M8,4A8,8 0 0,0 0,12A8,8 0 0,0 8,20H18A6,6 0 0,0 24,14A6,6 0 0,0 18,8V4H8M17,9A4,4 0 0,1 21,13A4,4 0 0,1 17,17H8A6,6 0 0,1 2,11A6,6 0 0,1 8,5H18V9H17Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </section>\n                <section style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4b5563;\">建立常态化的防汛减灾管理机制</section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 数据说明 -->\n        <section style=\"padding:10px 20px 30px; text-align:center;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:13px; color:#9ca3af; font-style:italic;\">本文数据综合自武汉防汛抗旱指挥部最新通报及气象部门监测数据</p>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 10px\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1><section><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a8a; display: flex\">留一点时间给自己</h2><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong>从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a8a; display: flex\">让行动变得简单</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px\">选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px\">留意自己的真实感受</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px\">给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>时段</th><th>安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>早晨</td><td>散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td>傍晚</td><td>回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section>",
